## INDEPENDENCE DECLARATION
I am the independent Loop C post-result auditor for PR-EXP-01. This audit is packet-only, read-only, and report-only: no tools, no file reads, no network, no edits were performed, and I had no role in the design, execution, or dispatch of this experiment. Every judgment is labelled FACT (entailed by packet fields), INFERENCE (reasoned from packet fields), or UNVERIFIED (evidence missing from the packet). Missing evidence is treated as UNVERIFIED, never as a pass. Disclosed incidents a1/a2 (INPUT_MISSING ×4, HASH_MISMATCH ×4) are treated as non-scientific engineering failures and are excluded from the scientific record of this experiment. I do not modify, re-run, or rescue the result.

## CHECKLIST
- C1: FACT — Frozen prereg followed on what is checkable: `receipt.pragma_sha256` equals the prereg entry in `input_hashes` (`41c6c3c…0cd3`), `deviations: []`, `phase_reached: "PHASE_0_STOP"` matches prereg §9, claim object held to `SYNTHETIC_NULL_SUPPORT_REPAIR` in both `receipt` and `result`, DSL exactly the four frozen rules, `panel_completeness` = "all and only … no sampling"; UNVERIFIED sub-point: the calibration/held-out partition (folds {0,1,2}/{3,4}) appears only in `implementation_contract` §7, not in prereg §3–§4, and the pre-result Loop C PASS rests on a capture-damaged log (`loop_c_prereg_audit_recheck_result_raw.log`, disclosed incident ii).
- C2: UNVERIFIED — Fold rule text is pinned verbatim (contract §7: `sorted(uid) % N_FOLDS`, N_FOLDS=5) and `result.harmful_side_read: false` proves no harmful-side contamination occurred, but the packet contains no UID lists, no fold assignment output, and no `panel.jsonl` contents, so UID overlap and split integrity cannot be independently confirmed; the disjointness claim (`excluded_injected_uid: 95`) is asserted, not shown.
- C3: FACT — No metric was defined or modified after results: `scoring_performed: false`, `raw_metrics.calibration/heldout_null/bridge` all "not applicable", `threshold_frozen_utc: null`; the threshold rule (prereg §4) and the 3/2 fold partition were frozen in the contract "before panel generation", i.e. before any score existed to look at.
